The '''Mos Eisley Mod Parlor''' was a mod parlor located on the outskirts of [[Mos Eisley]],<ref name="DB">{{Databank|mos-eisley-mod-parlor|Mos Eisley Mod Parlor}}</ref> a [[spaceport]] on the [[desert]] [[planet]] of [[Tatooine]].<ref name="Ultimate">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref> The mod parlor was owned by [[The Modifier]], who was an artisan when it came to [[Cybernetics|cybernetic]] augmentation. [[Gender|He]] [[Technician|engineered]] customized additions and enhancements to anyone with [[Currency|money]].<ref name="The Modifier">{{Databank|the-modifier|The Modifier}}</ref> The archway over the entrance featured a hand painted [[krayt dragon]] [[skeleton]], whose ribs formed the word "MODIFIER" written in [[Outer Rim Basic]]. Above that, the name "MER-A PLA", written in [[Aurebesh]], was carved into the top of the archway. The [[Mods]] often came to the mod parlor to replace their cybernetic components.<ref name="DB" /> In [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{MandoDate|5}} The flashback in [[Chapter 4: The Gathering Storm]] takes place shortly after the events of [[Chapter 5: The Gunslinger]], so the flashback must take place around 9 [['ABY-BBY' dating system|ABY]]</ref> [[Boba Fett]] brought [[Fennec Shand]] to the parlor to save her from [[Death|dying]]<ref name="The Gathering Storm" /> after the rookie [[bounty hunter]] [[Toro Calican]] shot her in the abdomen.<ref name="Chapter 5">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 5: The Gunslinger}}</ref>

